I needed a spit cup.

427
00:26:00.268 --> 00:26:01.894
Just eat around it.

428
00:26:01.978 --> 00:26:05.022
That's gross. Come on.
We gotta get on the road.

429
00:26:26.961 --> 00:26:30.173
Why don't you just admit it? We're lost!

430
