488
00:30:22.363 --> 00:30:24.365
You gotta be shitting me!

489
00:30:40.589 --> 00:30:44.301
Son of a bitch!
I'm gonna kill those miserable pissants!

490
00:30:51.892 --> 00:30:53.602
